docs {
  Fetch a checkpoint by sequence number or digest — or the latest one if
  neither is provided.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.LedgerService` · **Method:** `GetCheckpoint` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `checkpoint_id` (oneof, optional): either `sequence_number` (uint64) or
    `digest` (string). Omit both to get the latest checkpoint.
  - `read_mask` (optional FieldMask): defaults to `sequence_number,digest`.

  To fetch a specific checkpoint instead of the latest, replace the body
  with e.g. `{ "sequence_number": "12345", "read_mask": {...} }`.

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com` — also used to source real
  transaction digests for the `GetTransaction` / `BatchGetTransactions`
  examples in this collection.
}
